{"parse":{"title":"特性/锤铠鼬","pageid":7239,"revid":17851,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E9%94%A4%E9%93%A0%E9%BC%AC&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E9%94%A4%E9%93%A0%E9%BC%AC&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E9%94%A4%E9%93%A0%E9%BC%AC&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>锤铠鼬</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E9.94.A4.E9.93.A0.E9.BC.AC\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"锤铠鼬\"><b>锤铠鼬</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">特性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"特性 锤铠鼬.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/68/rj65n2gm87rwkymh3bef8ii8jc06k68.png/80px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E9%94%A4%E9%93%A0%E9%BC%AC.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/68/rj65n2gm87rwkymh3bef8ii8jc06k68.png/120px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E9%94%A4%E9%93%A0%E9%BC%AC.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/68/rj65n2gm87rwkymh3bef8ii8jc06k68.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />锤铠鼬\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:55%;\">\n<p>✦每战斗回合首次受到伤害后会蜷缩，蜷缩时最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>。<br />✦蜷缩时，受到伤害会进行攻击，而自身被击退时，击退距离增加<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>格。<br />✦行动开始时，会解除[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">蜷缩</span>]姿态。<br />✦受到环境伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">90%</font>。<br />✦被攻击后，若自身生命值低于<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>，则受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"守护失效\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">守护失效</font></span></span>]，触发时，无法蜷缩，受到伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">200%</font>，并且掉落[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"锤铠鼬背甲\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">锤铠鼬背甲</font></span></span>]。<br />拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自然守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">自然守护</font></span></span>]，效果：<br />✦最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:25%;\" rowspan=\"1\"><b>该特性属于</b><br /><div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%94%A4%E9%93%A0%E9%BC%AC\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/锤铠鼬\"><img alt=\"锤铠鼬 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/27/ozndky7zxo998hmxx5w7vz5gwt7rfbp.png/75px-%E9%94%A4%E9%93%A0%E9%BC%AC_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/27/ozndky7zxo998hmxx5w7vz5gwt7rfbp.png/113px-%E9%94%A4%E9%93%A0%E9%BC%AC_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/2/27/ozndky7zxo998hmxx5w7vz5gwt7rfbp.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164157\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.064 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.101 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 501/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 10754/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3278/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   82.521      1 模板:特性\n100.00%   82.521      1 -total\n 49.60%   40.927      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n 44.37%   36.618      4 模板:中括号介绍\n 15.23%   12.571      1 模板:魔物图\n 11.03%    9.104      1 模板:面包屑\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:7239-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022164157 and revision id 17851. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"特性","missing":true}],"images":["特性_锤铠鼬.png","锤铠鼬_像素模型.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"<b>锤铠鼬</b>","number":"1","index":"T-1","fromtitle":"模板:特性","byteoffset":null,"anchor":"锤铠鼬"}],"displaytitle":"特性/锤铠鼬","wikitext":"{{特性\n|魔物名称=锤铠鼬\n|特性名称=锤铠鼬\n|特性图标=锤铠鼬\n|特性描述=✦每战斗回合首次受到伤害后会蜷缩，蜷缩时最终受到伤害降低<font color=#ed7950>40%</font>。<br>✦蜷缩时，受到伤害会进行攻击，而自身被击退时，击退距离增加<font color=#ed7950>10</font>格。<br>✦行动开始时，会解除[蜷缩]姿态。<br>✦受到环境伤害降低<font color=#ed7950>90%</font>。<br>✦被攻击后，若自身生命值低于<font color=#ed7950>50%</font>，则受到[<font color=#f3c156>守护失效</font>]，触发时，无法蜷缩，受到伤害提高<font color=#ed7950>200%</font>，并且掉落[<font color=#54b4db>锤铠鼬背甲</font>]。<br>拥有[<font color=#f3c156>自然守护</font>]，效果：<br>✦最终受到伤害降低<font color=#ed7950>40%</font>。\n}}"},"capturedAt":"2026-10-22T16:41:58.100354+00:00"}